  <h2 class="cs__h rv" id="s4">Navy for trust, gold for action</h2>
  <p class="cs__p rv">
    The client wanted the site to stay clean, professional and corporate, built on the existing
    IVISATS logo and colours. Navy from the logo carries the header, hero and footer, gold marks
    labels and the main calls to action, and warm off-white keeps long pages easy to read.
  </p>
