<section class="cs__sec" aria-labelledby="s7">
  <p class="st-k rv">07 · Reflection</p>
  <h2 class="cs__h rv" id="s7">A slogan is a design brief</h2>
  <p class="cs__p rv">
    “Making Visa Applications Simple” is a promise, and the website is the first place a client tests
    it. Clear structure, a visible process and honest expectations do more to keep that promise than
    visuals alone.
  </p>
  <div class="st-grid st-g2 st-wide">
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Learning</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">Trust comes from clarity</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">
        Showing the steps, and saying plainly who makes the final decision, builds more confidence
        than bold claims.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Growth</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">Designing for what comes next</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">
        Keeping visas in focus while leaving room for travel services meant planning a structure that
        can grow with the business.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
